{
  "feature": "Passport \u00b7 fixed leaf height, two leaves a spread: the last spread's blank partner",
  "note": "Boards: design/design_handoff_bplus_redesign/addendum-8/screens/02/passport-odd-m, passport-spread2-d, passport-zero-m. The sheet photographs the signed-in user's second spread at desktop width (the phone has no Next button to click). An odd last page needs a signed-in account with 5 to 7 past nights; the zero state needs an account with none, which `passport-open-book.json` covers. Walk the phone's swipe and the 320px ID page by hand.",
  "widths": [
    {
      "label": "desktop",
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 900
    }
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "passport-stack",
      "label": "/passport: ID page and page 1, 300px leaves",
      "widths": [
        {
          "label": "xs",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 640
        },
        {
          "label": "phone",
          "width": 390,
          "height": 844
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
